<http://data.silknow.org/object/c9669209-2e37-3985-b6e7-1d27262e3d55>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Three side-by-side rows with small rectangular areas, one above the other, having simple, open, geometric, linear and floral designs worked in a lace-like fashion. Fourth row includes a lengthwise stylized leaf motif in blue silk chenille yarns. Mounted on a pink linen ground. Edged with white silk ribbon. In one corner are three letters in black silk yarns; partially rotted out.   Slightly soiled.   Stitches:  filling and interlacing stitches."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/92272cc4-5879-36fd-9e7b-47942b671ab7> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Three side-by-side rows with small rectangular areas, one above the other, having simple, open, geometric, linear and floral designs worked in a lace-like fashion. Fourth row includes a lengthwise stylized leaf motif in blue silk chenille yarns. Mounted on a pink linen ground. Edged with white silk ribbon. In one corner are three letters in black silk yarns; partially rotted out.   Slightly soiled.   Stitches:  filling and interlacing stitches."@en ;
